 "summary": "A small N-channel enhancement MOSFET in the three-lead SOT-23, rated 30 V drain to source and 0.1 A continuous drain current (0.4 A pulsed). On-resistance is at most 8 Ω with 4 V on the gate and 13 Ω with 2.5 V; the threshold lies between 0.8 V and 1.5 V. A built-in diode between gate and source protects the gate. It is offered for interfacing and load switching.",
